  "definition": "Work Registration",
  "effectiveDate": "2014-06-30",
  "historyNote": "#2234, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2930, eff 12-21-84, EXPIRED: 12-21-90 New. #5150, eff 5-6-91; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97; ss by #7250, eff 4-30-00; ss by #7993, eff 11-26-03; ss by #9529, eff 8-17-09; ss by #10627, eff 6-30-14",
